{"title":"Baby Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 9 times (1.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 4,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1\n        }</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ember-gland\">Ember Gland</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>490</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>900</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>613</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>252</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>458</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>447</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>490</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>900</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>613</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>252</td><td>in the wilds around 2106, 424</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>458</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>447</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr></tbody></tab